 "finalText": "All 31 tests pass. Here's what was changed:\n\n1. **`src/WinOptimizer/Core/Snapshot.cs`** — Added `public DateTime SavedAt { get; set; }` to the `Snapshot` class.\n2. **`src/WinOptimizer/Services/SnapshotStore.cs`** — `SaveSnapshot` now sets `snapshot.SavedAt = DateTime.UtcNow` before serializing.\n3. **`tests/WinOptimizer.Tests/SnapshotStoreTests.cs`** — Added `SaveSnapshot_Then_Load_HasSavedAtWithinAMinuteOfNow` which saves a snapshot, loads it, and asserts `SavedAt` is within 60 seconds of `DateTime.UtcNow`.\n\nNo ViewModels were touched. The JSON round-trip works because `DateTime` serializes/deserializes natively with `System.Text.Json`."
